          "language": "en",
          "text": "Being successful with the eligibility for the University she most wanted to enter, she was so glad she couldn't help jumping up.",
          "html": "<span>Being successful with the eligibility for the University she most wanted to enter, she was </span><strong>so </strong><span>glad </span><span>she couldn't help jumping up. </span>",
          "segments": [
