  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "can be used for both good and bad things.\n\n心配のあまり \nbecause of too much anxiety.\n\n嬉しさのあまりとび上がった。 \nI was so glad I couldnt help jumping up",
      "html": "can be used for both good and bad things.<br/><br/>心配のあまり <br/>because of too much anxiety.<br/><br/>嬉しさのあまりとび上がった。 <br/>I was so glad I couldnt help jumping up",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
