      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "[動-辞書形 / た形；な形-な；名-の]＋あまり",
      "html": "[動-辞書形 / た形；な形-な；名-の]＋あまり",
